<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: {1} is already {0}'s favourite food! The recipe book won't provide further insights-->
  <VCEV_AlreadyFavourite>{1} 已经是 {0} 最喜欢的食物！食谱书不会提供进一步的见解</VCEV_AlreadyFavourite>
  <!--EN: Go back-->
  <VCEV_GoBack>回去</VCEV_GoBack>
  <!--EN: High Food Variety Threshold-->
  <VCEV_HighVarietyThreshold>食物品种门槛高</VCEV_HighVarietyThreshold>
  <!--EN: Colonists with higher food variety than this will get positive mood effects. 60% by default.-->
  <VCEV_HighVarietyThresholdDesc>食物种类比这更多的殖民者将会获得积极的情绪影响。默认为 60%。</VCEV_HighVarietyThresholdDesc>
  <!--EN: Low Food Variety Threshold-->
  <VCEV_LowVarietyThreshold>食物品种门槛低</VCEV_LowVarietyThreshold>
  <!--EN: Colonists with lower food variety than this will get negative mood effects. 30% by default.-->
  <VCEV_LowVarietyThresholdDesc>食物种类低于此的殖民者将会受到负面情绪影响。默认为 30%。</VCEV_LowVarietyThresholdDesc>
  <!--EN: Mood offset-->
  <VCEV_MoodMultiplier>情绪偏移</VCEV_MoodMultiplier>
  <!--EN: Both negative and positive moods produced by low and high Food Variety need will be multiplied by this number. +/- 5 by default.-->
  <VCEV_MoodMultiplierDesc>低和高食物种类需求产生的消极和积极情绪都会乘以这个数字。默认为 +/- 5。</VCEV_MoodMultiplierDesc>
  <!--EN: {0} has decided that {1} is now their favourite food too!-->
  <VCEV_NewFavouriteGained>{0} 决定 {1} 现在也是他们最喜欢的食物！</VCEV_NewFavouriteGained>
  <!--EN: {0} already has two favourite foods. The recipe book won't provide further insights-->
  <VCEV_NoMoreFavourites>{0} 已经有两种最喜欢的食物。食谱书不会提供进一步的见解</VCEV_NoMoreFavourites>
  <!--EN: Number of ingredient stack per meal (requires reload)-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfIngredientStacked>每餐的食材堆叠数量（需要重新加载）</VCEV_NumberOfIngredientStacked>
  <!--EN: By default, vanilla meals start deleting "common" ingredients after 3 ingredients. This allows you to increase that limit. Requires a mod reload to take effect.-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfIngredientStackedDesc>默认情况下，香草餐在 3 种成分之后开始删除“常见”成分。这允许您增加该限制。需要重新加载 mod 才能生效。</VCEV_NumberOfIngredientStackedDesc>
  <!--EN: Number of latest ingredients to count-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfIngredients>要计算的最新成分数量</VCEV_NumberOfIngredients>
  <!--EN: The food variety need level will be calculated by counting among this number of ingredients consumed. Default is 7 latest ingredients.-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfIngredientsDesc>食物种类需求水平将通过计算消耗的食材数量来计算。默认为 7 种最新成分。</VCEV_NumberOfIngredientsDesc>
  <!--EN: Number of latest meals to count-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfMeals>最近计算的用餐次数</VCEV_NumberOfMeals>
  <!--EN: The food variety need level will be calculated by counting among this number of meals consumed. Default is 7 latest meals.-->
  <VCEV_NumberOfMealsDesc>食物种类需求水平将通过计算消耗的膳食数量来计算。默认为最近 7 餐。</VCEV_NumberOfMealsDesc>
  <!--EN: Reset-->
  <VCEV_Reset>重置</VCEV_Reset>
  <!--EN: This is {PAWN_nameDef}'s favourite meal, and counts as two meals for the purpose of food variety.-->
  <VCEV_ThisIsFavourite>这是{PAWN_nameDef}最喜欢的一餐，出于食物多样性的目的，它算作两餐。</VCEV_ThisIsFavourite>
  <!--EN: This is {PAWN_nameDef}'s favourite ingredient, and counts as two ingredients for the purpose of food variety.-->
  <VCEV_ThisIsFavouriteIng>这是{PAWN_nameDef}最喜欢的成分，就食物多样性而言，它算作两种成分。</VCEV_ThisIsFavouriteIng>
  <!--EN: Favourite meal or ingredient: {0}-->
  <VCE_FavouriteFood>最喜欢的食物或配料：{0}</VCE_FavouriteFood>
  <!--EN: Consuming this meal or ingredient will give a +2 bonus to variety-->
  <VCE_FavouriteFoodEffects>食用这顿饭或配料会给多样性带来+2奖励</VCE_FavouriteFoodEffects>
  <!--EN: Favourite meal or ingredient:-->
  <VCE_FavouriteFoodTextOnly>最喜欢的膳食或成分：</VCE_FavouriteFoodTextOnly>
  <!--EN: Ingredient Variety: {0}/{1}-->
  <VCE_IngredientVariety>成分种类：{0}/{1}</VCE_IngredientVariety>
  <!--EN: Since {0}'s favourite ingredient has been consumed, variety in this category will get a +2 bonus per favourite!-->
  <VCE_IngredientsHasFavourites>由于 {0} 最喜欢的成分已被消耗，因此此类别中的品种将获得每个最喜欢的 +2 奖励！</VCE_IngredientsHasFavourites>
  <!--EN: Last eaten meals: {0}-->
  <VCE_LastFoods>最后吃的饭菜：{0}</VCE_LastFoods>
  <!--EN: Last eaten meals:-->
  <VCE_LastFoodsTextOnly>最后吃的饭菜：</VCE_LastFoodsTextOnly>
  <!--EN: Last eaten ingredients: {0}-->
  <VCE_LastIngredients>最后吃的食材：{0}</VCE_LastIngredients>
  <!--EN: Last eaten ingredients:-->
  <VCE_LastIngredientsTextOnly>最后吃的食材：</VCE_LastIngredientsTextOnly>
  <!--EN: Meal Variety: {0}/{1}-->
  <VCE_MealVariety>膳食品种：{0}/{1}</VCE_MealVariety>
  <!--EN: Since {0}'s favourite food has been consumed, variety in this category will get a +2 bonus per favourite!-->
  <VCE_MealsHasFavourites>由于 {0} 最喜欢的食物已被食用，此类别中的品种每喜爱一个将获得 +2 奖励！</VCE_MealsHasFavourites>
  <!--EN: Not eaten yet-->
  <VCE_NotEatenYet>还没吃</VCE_NotEatenYet>
  <!--EN: Average Total: {0}%-->
  <VCE_TotalVariety>平均 总计：{0}%</VCE_TotalVariety>
</LanguageData>
